>I found out my character's (neutral Valkyrie) attributes include
>the following:
>Good luck does not time out for you
>Bad luck does not time out for you

>Could someone shed some light on what this means?  Is it good or bad?
>How might I have acquired these attributes?  Can/should I get rid of them?

Spoilers ho!


Your valkyrie is carrying an uncursed luckstone.  This is good if your
luck is high and bad if it is low.  But most characters usually do
fine in the luck department, so I consider an uncursed luckstone
to be a good thing.  Just go sacrifice-crazy at a coaligned altar,
and you'll peg your luck.  Then the stone will keep it there.  You
also get some cool toys from that nice guy Odin in the process.

A blessed luckstone will allow only bad luck to time out.  This is
even better.  I usually bless mine, unless I'm really short of 
holy water.  I'll bet you can guess what a cursed one does by 
now.

